    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864676600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return a helmet.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 99136,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864682800000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. May I have your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864684733333
    },
    {
      "text": "VF781-9902.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 99136,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864689533333
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see the Trail Helmet purchased about 70 days ago. To process this correctly, could you tell me what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864690466666
    },
    {
      "text": "I just don't like it. The color isn't what I expected.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 99136,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864704533332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Color can definitely look different online versus in person. Let me just check the return eligibility for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864708333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 99136,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864716799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, thank you for your patience. I've reviewed your order, and it looks like you are unfortunately outside our 10-day return window. I cannot approve this return for a full refund.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864717599998
    },
    {
