      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 99136,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864730133331
    },
    {
      "text": "That's great to hear. Yes, I've just initiated the return process. I'm sending a prepaid shipping label to the email address on file right now. Just print it out, attach it to the shipping box, and you can drop it off at any UPS location.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864733733331
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 99136,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768864749799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Once we receive the helmet, your refund will be processed within 3-5 business days. While this one wasn't the right fit, I do hope you'll consider us again for your future needs. Our top priority is rider safety.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
